     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><b>From:</b> Acre, Matthew R &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ma...@usgs.gov</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Friday, September 13, 2024 17:26<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> Acre, Matthew R &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ma...@usgs.gov</a>&gt;; Calfee, Robin D &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rca...@usgs.gov</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> Position Announcement - GS-11 Postdoc - USGS CERC - Abundance Modeling</span></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:12pt\">All,</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:12pt\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:12pt\">Please see the\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(5,99,193)\"><u><a href=\"https://www.usajobs.gov/job/809477200\" style=\"color:rgb(5,99,193);margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.usajobs.gov/job/809477200&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792448303439000&amp;usg=AOvVaw39J0SQOuli_x_PI7HEA0G8\">job\r\n announcement</a></u></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:12pt\"> for a position with the U.S. Geological Survey at the Columbia Environmental Research Center (CERC). We are hiring a postdoc to tackle some abundance modeling\r\n challenges in the Great Lakes. Please forward this on to any PhD students who may be nearing completion of their work or freshly-minted PhDs that may be a good fit for the position with the Quantitative and Conservation Ecology (QCE) team at USGS-CERC.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:12pt\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:12pt\">The QCE team focuses on cutting-edge research in invasive species management, population dynamics, and conservation.\r\n We collaborate with scientists, managers, and policymakers on multi-disciplinary projects, including dam removal and invasive fish studies. Our team blends hands-on fieldwork with advanced quantitative methods, offering opportunities to apply data science\r\n to real-world ecological problems. Joining us means contributing to impactful conservation efforts and gaining expertise in innovative research techniques.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:12pt\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:12pt\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:12pt\">Sincerely,</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:12pt\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:12pt\">Matthew Acre, Ph.D.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:12pt\">USGS Research Biologist</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:12pt\">Columbia Environmental Research Center</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:12pt\">RPCV Cape Verde ’10-‘12</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:12pt\"><a href=\"tel:(573)%20890-0300\" value=\"+15738900300\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">573-890-0300</a></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"> </p>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><b>From:</b> Acre, Matthew R &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ma...@usgs.gov</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Friday, September 13, 2024 17:26<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> Acre, Matthew R &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ma...@usgs.gov</a>&gt;; Calfee, Robin D &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rca...@usgs.gov</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> Position Announcement - GS-11 Postdoc - USGS CERC - Abundance Modeling</span>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:12pt\">All,</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:12pt\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-fam